---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
const title = "UI/UX Designer";
const description = "Crayonweb is hiring a UI/UX Designer! Create user-friendly, visually compelling interfaces for websites and mobile apps, collaborate with a dynamic team, and contribute to projects that make a real difference. Apply today and grow your career with us.";
const canonical = "https://stage.woodwolfdigital.com/ui-ux-designer/";
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} type="website">
  <div class="container" style="padding:3rem 1rem">
    <h1>UI/UX Designer</h1>
    <p>Crayonweb is hiring a UI/UX Designer! Create user-friendly, visually compelling interfaces for websites and mobile apps, collaborate with a dynamic team, and contribute to projects that make a real difference. Apply today and grow your career with us.</p>
    <h2>Job Details</h2>
    <ul><li>Vacancy: No of Vacancies: 03</li></ul>
<ul>
      <li>Location: Bhavnagar-Gujarat</li>
      <li>Date: 29 August 2025</li>
      <li>Job Type: Full Time (On Site)</li>
      <li>Working Hours: 10 AM to 07 PM</li>
      <li>Working Days: Weekly 6 days (Mon to Sat)</li>
      <li>Salary: As Per Eligibility</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Join Our Growing Family of Innovators</h2>
    <p>CrayonWeb is seeking a talented and passionate UI/UX Designer to join our innovative digital agency. As part of our creative team, you will be responsible for designing visually compelling and user-friendly digital experiences across websites, mobile applications, and web platforms. You will collaborate closely with web developers, creative artists, TYPO3 specialists, and mobile app experts to ensure a seamless, intuitive experience for our users. In this role, you will translate business requirements and user needs into wireframes, prototypes, and high-fidelity designs, ensuring that every interface is functional, aesthetically appealing, and optimized for engagement. You will conduct user research, usability testing, and collaborate with stakeholders to iterate on designs that enhance usability and drive meaningful results. At CrayonWeb, we value creativity, collaboration, and innovation. You will have the opportunity to work on a diverse range of projects, from corporate websites and mobile applications to custom digital solutions, while continuously developing your skills and exploring new design trends. Our inclusive and supportive work culture ensures your ideas are heard, your contributions recognized, and your professional growth nurtured. We are looking for someone who is detail-oriented, creative, and passionate about crafting exceptional user experiences. Strong skills in UI/UX design tools, wireframing, prototyping, and responsive design are essential. Knowledge of TYPO3 or other CMS platforms is a plus. Join CrayonWeb and be part of a growing family of innovators where your designs will make a real impact. If you are ready to push the boundaries of digital experiences, collaborate with a talented team, and create interfaces that delight users, we want to hear from you!</p>
    <h2>requirements</h2>
    <p>Experience: At least 1 year</p>
    <h3>Additional Requirements</h3>
<h4>Technical &amp; Design Skills</h4><ul><li>Proficiency in design and prototyping tools (Figma, Adobe XD, Sketch, InVision)</li><li>Strong understanding of user-centered design principles</li><li>Wireframing, mockups, and high-fidelity UI design</li><li>Responsive and mobile-first design</li><li>Familiarity with HTML, CSS, and basic front-end concepts</li><li>Knowledge of TYPO3 or other CMS platforms (optional but a plus)</li></ul>
    <h4>Analytical &amp; Research Skills</h4><ul><li>Conducting user research and usability testing</li><li>Analyzing user behavior and translating insights into design improvements</li><li>A/B testing and data-driven design decisions</li></ul>
    <h4>Soft Skills</h4><ul><li>Strong communication and collaboration with cross-functional teams</li><li>Problem-solving and creative thinking</li><li>Attention to detail and design consistency</li><li>Time management and ability to handle multiple projects</li></ul>
    <h2>Email your CV</h2>
    <p>Send your CV to the given email <a href="mailto:hr@crayonwebstudio.com">hr@crayonwebstudio.com</a></p>
    <h2>Apply Position</h2>
<form>
      <p><label>Your first name<br /><input type="text" name="first_name" /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your last name<br /><input type="text" name="last_name" /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your email address *<br /><input type="email" name="email" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your phone number *<br /><input type="tel" name="phone" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Working Experience *<br /><input type="text" name="experience" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Upload CV *<br /><input type="file" name="cv" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your message<br /><textarea name="message" rows="5"></textarea></label></p>
      <p><button type="submit">Submit</button></p>
    </form>
    <p>Note: this form is front end only on this staging site, so nothing is sent. Email your CV to <a href="mailto:hr@crayonwebstudio.com">hr@crayonwebstudio.com</a> instead.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
